    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">

            <article class="service-detail">
                <div class="detail-photo photo-1"><span class="card-tag">01</span></div>
                <div class="detail-text">
                    <h2>Digital Inventory Targeting</h2>
                    <p>Put your specific vehicles in front of active car buyers in your local radius using dynamic social media ads.</p>
                    <ul class="check-list">
                        <li>Ads built around the vehicles you actually have on your lot</li>
                        <li>Targeting set to your dealership's local area</li>
                        <li>Placements on both Facebook and Instagram</li>
                        <li>Ongoing adjustments as your inventory changes</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="best-for"><b>Best for:</b> dealers who want specific vehicles seen by nearby shoppers.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="service-detail reverse">
                <div class="detail-photo photo-2"><span class="card-tag">02</span></div>
                <div class="detail-text">
                    <h2>Showroom Retargeting</h2>
                    <p>Re-engage people who browsed your inventory but haven't booked a test drive yet.</p>
                    <ul class="check-list">
                        <li>Follow-up ads for people who looked at your vehicles online</li>
                        <li>Reminders about the cars they were interested in</li>
                        <li>A clear next step, like booking a test drive or sending a message</li>
                        <li>Ad frequency kept reasonable so the ads help rather than annoy</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="best-for"><b>Best for:</b> dealers who get steady online interest and want to win back shoppers who haven't come in yet.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="service-detail">
                <div class="detail-photo photo-3"><span class="card-tag">03</span></div>
                <div class="detail-text">
                    <h2>Lead Generation Campaigns</h2>
                    <p>Capture inquiries straight from Facebook and Instagram so your sales team can follow up while buyers are interested.</p>
                    <ul class="check-list">
                        <li>Inquiry options right inside Facebook and Instagram</li>
                        <li>Contact details sent to you so your team can respond quickly</li>
                        <li>Campaigns aimed at inquiries and appointments, not just views</li>
                        <li>Adjusted over time based on what is bringing in the best leads</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="best-for"><b>Best for:</b> dealers who want more inquiries and appointments on the books.</p>
                </div>
            </article>

        </div>
    </section>

